{
  "$schema": "../../../../schemas/security.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "The identity provider's rights, shipped as a library layer (docs/identity_provider_platform_PRD.md D2,",
    "spike S1). Two slots the application binds in its own security.json:",
    "  identity-provider:administrators - every application and resource, developer requests, reviews",
    "  identity-provider:developers     - the developer portal: their own applications and APIs",
    "Membership of the developers group comes from the provider itself (approved developer requests),",
    "never from seeding. Which rows a developer reaches is OidcApplicationActions / OidcResourceActions",
    "GetRowFilterAsync: members only, owners only. ManageAll/IdentityProvider lifts both filters.",
    "Drop one grant with { \"key\": \"identity-provider:<key>\", \"$remove\": true }, or all of them with",
    "\"libraries\": { \"identity-provider\": false }.",
    "AsDetail rows are judged by their own row type's rights (EntityMapper): without New/OidcApplicationScope",
    "no application could be saved with a scope. ClientClaim rows are the administrators' only: a claim such",
    "as group=... on a client's tokens is a grant at every resource server, not a developer's to set."
  ],
  "reservedTargets": [
    "IdentityProvider"
  ],
